Template: libhyperscan/cpu-ssse3
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Really install package?
 This CPU lacks support for the Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions
 3 (SSSE3) instruction set that is required to execute programs linked
 against hyperscan.
Description-de.UTF-8: Paket installieren?
 Der CPU dieses Systems fehlt die "Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions 3" (SSSE3) Befehlssatzwerweiterung. Diese ist Voraussetzung, um Programme auszuführen, die die hyperscan-Bibliothek verwenden.
Description-fr.UTF-8: Faut-il vraiment installer le paquet ?
 Le processeur ne supporte pas le jeu d'instructions Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions 3 (SSSE3) nécessaire pour exécuter les programmes liés à hyperscan.
Description-nl.UTF-8: Dit pakket echt installeren?
 Deze CPU biedt geen ondersteuning voor de instructieset 'Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions 3 (SSSE3)'. Die is nodig voor het uitvoeren van programma's die met hyperscan gelinkt zijn.
Description-pt.UTF-8: Tem a certeza que quer instalar o pacote?
 Este CPU não possuí suporte a um conjunto de instruções de extensões Supplemental Streaming SIMD (SSS3) necessário para executar programas ligados ao hyperscan.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Realmente instalar o pacote?
 Essa CPU não tem suporte ao conjunto de instruções "Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions 3" (SSSE3) que é necessário para executar programas lincados ao hyperscan.
Description-ru.UTF-8: Действительно установить этот пакет?
 У данного ЦП отсутствует поддержки набора инструкций Supplemental Streaming SIMD Extensions 3 (SSSE3), который требуется для выполнения программ, скомпонованных с hyperscan.
Description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 確定安裝此套件?
 CPU需支援 SSSE3 指令集, 才能執行 hyperscan
